### Get all enrollments
GET http://localhost:5500/api/enrollments

### Get enrollment by id
GET http://localhost:5500/api/enrollments/enroll-001

### Create enrollment
POST http://localhost:5500/api/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "studentId": "stu-004",
    "sessionId": "session-001"
}

### Update enrollment
PUT http://localhost:5500/api/enrollments/enroll-004
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "status": "confirmed"
}

### Delete enrollment
DELETE http://localhost:5500/api/enrollments/enroll-005